Package: devbox
Version: 0.1.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Maintainer: Devbox contributors
Description: Native development environment manager
 Devbox discovers installed host runtimes, runs projects as the current user,
 and manages explicitly configured user-owned service processes.
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libasound2, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxrandr2, libvulkan1, xdg-desktop-portal
